cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework or its data, please cite the archived release of TECF."
type: software
title: "TECF – Transformation-Enabling Conditions Framework"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Reinecke
    given-names: Thomas
    affiliation: IU International University of Applied Sciences
abstract: >-
  Companion web application of the master thesis "Enterprise Transformation Readiness:
  A Design Science Study of Transformation-Enabling Conditions Operationalised in an
  AI-Supported Governance Application" (M.Sc. Artificial Intelligence, 2026). It presents
  the framework of 60 transformation-enabling Conditions in nine Condition Domains and
  traces every Condition back to its Condition Findings, their audited source passages,
  and the contributing publications.
keywords:
  - transformation readiness
  - digital transformation
  - enterprise architecture
  - IT governance
  - design science research
  - operationalisation
  - AI-based automation
license:
  - CC-BY-NC-4.0
  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/thomasreinecke/TECF"
url: "https://thomasreinecke.github.io/TECF/"
